# .env - secrets and addresses for Wepwawet Veil (copy to .env; never committed).
# Secrets can also live in the vault (Security page), which is read first.
# The way Off-Platform, for what the house can't answer: any OpenAI-compatible endpoint (LiteLLM in the
# tested setup). Leave it out to answer at home only. LITELLM_URL and LITELLM_KEY, the older names, still work.
OFF_PLATFORM_URL=http://192.168.1.20:4000
OFF_PLATFORM_KEY=sk-...
DONETICK_TOKEN=
# OREAD_TOKEN=                      # an Oread API token (role reviewer), for who spoke
# HA_TOKEN=                         # only with integrations: oread: source: home_assistant
# hand files the router writes back to you (your user id:group id; `id` shows them)
FILE_OWNER=1000:1000
# where your datasets and books live (default ~/datasets)
# DATASETS_DIR=/home/you/datasets
